          "jcr:created": "Wed Dec 27 2023 00:57:23 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The Phalinx Hammertoe is a versatile system designed to address hammertoe correction and MTP joint instability.</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Titanium implants eliminate need for freezer storage</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Implants available in straight cannulated and 10° angled</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Color-coded implants and instruments increase system efficiency<br>\n </span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 26 2024 14:07:53 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
